sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cliente as Cliente (SocketClient)
    participant Server as SocketServer
    participant Acceptor as ConnectionAcceptor
    participant Supervisor as ConnectionSupervisor
    participant Conn as ClientConnection
    participant Registry as ClientRegistry
    participant HandlerReg as HandlerRegistry
    participant Handler as RideCostHandler

    Note over Server, Acceptor: Inicialização do Servidor TCP (Porta efêmera ou 3000)
    Server->>Acceptor: start()
    activate Acceptor

    Note over Cliente, Acceptor: Conexão e Handshake de Object Streams
    Cliente->>Acceptor: TCP Connect (SYN / ACK)
    Acceptor->>Supervisor: new ConnectionSupervisor(socket, clientRegistry, handlerRegistry)
    Acceptor->>Supervisor: start()
    activate Supervisor
    
    Supervisor->>Conn: new ClientConnection(socket, in, out)
    activate Conn
    Supervisor->>Registry: add(clientConnection)
    
    Note over Cliente, Handler: Transmissão da Requisição de Negócio
    Cliente->>Conn: writeObject(RideCostRequest)
    Conn->>Supervisor: receive() -> RideCostRequest
    
    Supervisor->>HandlerReg: dispatch(RideCostRequest)
    activate HandlerReg
    HandlerReg->>Handler: execute(RideCostRequest)
    activate Handler
    Handler-->>HandlerReg: RideCostResponse (custos e rateio calculados)
    deactivate Handler
    HandlerReg-->>Supervisor: RideCostResponse
    deactivate HandlerReg

    Supervisor->>Conn: send(RideCostResponse)
    Conn->>Cliente: writeObject(RideCostResponse)
    
    Note over Cliente, Supervisor:Desconexão Graciosa do Cliente
    Cliente->>Conn: writeObject(DisconnectRequest)
    Conn->>Supervisor: receive() -> DisconnectRequest
    Supervisor->>Registry: remove(clientConnection)
    Supervisor->>Conn: close()
    deactivate Conn
    Supervisor-->>Acceptor: Thread finalizada com sucesso
    deactivate Supervisor
    deactivate Acceptor